    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n79112" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρά-χρωσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>use of the chromatic scale</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ
				ἐν τοῖς μέλεσι π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.645d
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>colouring</i>, metaph. of character, <i><span class="en">
				Simp.
				<u>in Cat.</u>
				216.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>faint image</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκιάς τινας ἡδονῶν καὶ -χρώσεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>in Epict.</u>
					p.21
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>in Ph.</u>
				280.16
			</span></i>.</div>
